# 🚀 SJSU Deep Learning: Assignment 2 - Advanced AI Coding Tools

Welcome to my submission for **Assignment 2: Learn Latest AI Coding Tools**. This repository demonstrates the practical application of cutting-edge AI tools (Gemini API, Google Colab, Cursor, Hugging Face) to build multimodal AI notebooks, full-stack web apps, mobile apps, and deep learning classifiers.

